\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Vietnam c.bank to increase  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  sales frequency to ensure supply to market\b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2022\par 14:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, context)\par \par \uc2 HANOI, June 20 (Reuters) - The \uc2 State Bank of Vietnam (SBV) \uc2 said on Monday it will increase the frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales to be ready to supply foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the market more often amid bearish global market conditions.\par \par \uc2 The dollar/Vietnamese dong exchange rate has risen 2% from the beginning of this year, in contrast to the downward trend witnessed last year, the \uc2 SBV\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 SBV\uc2  will manage exchange rate in a way that creates room for the rate to move flexibly and absorb external shocks, at the same time it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to limit excessive fluctuations of the exchange rate," it said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it managed to buy large amounts of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and increase its reserves thanks to favourable financial conditions in recent years.\par \par \uc2 As of March this year, Vietnam's foreign reserves had reached a record of $110 billion, official data showed.\par \par \uc2 "In the context of unfavourable market movements, the \uc2 SBV\uc2  has been and will continue to sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilise the market to facilitate and support foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs," it said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SBV\uc2  did not state how much it had sold to the market.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a sensitive issue for \b \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In the latest semi-annual report published by the \uc2 U.S. Treasury Department\uc2  last week, Vietnam also continued to exceed some thresholds for possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulation.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Phuong Nguyen; Editing by Kanupriya Kapoor) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-6-20T13:56:30.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220620ei6k020ge\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
