\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 U.S. Deems Vietnam  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Acts a Burden; No Duties Planned\b0\par\par\uc2 458 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 (Bloomberg) -- The U.S. labeled Vietnam\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  actions unreasonable and restrictive to American businesses, but refrained from hitting the nation with punitive tariffs.\par \par \uc2 The determination by the office of the U.S. Trade Representative is the result of an investigation that started in October under section 301 of the Trade Act of 1974 -- the same legislation the Trump administration has used to apply tariffs on billions of dollars of imports from China.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s practices -- including \u8220\'20\'1Cexcessive\u8221\'20\'1D \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- are \u8220\'20\'1Cunreasonable and burden or restrict U.S. commerce,\u8221\'20\'1D the USTR said in a statement Friday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUnfair acts, policies and practices that contribute to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undervaluation harm U.S. workers and businesses, and need to be addressed,\u8221\'20\'1D U.S. Trade Representative \uc2 Robert Lighthizer\uc2  said in the statement. \u8220\'20\'1CI hope that the U.S. and Vietnam can find a path for addressing our concerns.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Dec. 16, the \uc2 U.S. Treasury Department\uc2  designated Vietnam and Switzerland as \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulators for the first time, while keeping China on a watch list, in the Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s final \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy report.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Chamber of Commerce\uc2  welcomed the decision not to impose tariffs.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have been steadfast in our opposition to this move since the announcement that it was under consideration,\u8221\'20\'1D Executive Vice President and Head of International Affairs Myron Brilliant said in the chamber\u8217\'20\'19s statement. \u8220\'20\'1CTrade actions are an inappropriate means by which to address \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -valuation questions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Information Technology Industry Council\uc2  said Vietnam is a growing hub for supply-chain partners, especially as companies seek to move supply chains outside of China.\par \par \uc2 President-elect \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and his trade team should avoid imposing tariffs on Vietnam \u8220\'20\'1Cand instead rely on a strategic, whole-of-government approach that uses bilateral engagement to tackle concerns around \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  valuation,\u8221\'20\'1D the ITI said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam is among the U.S.\u8217\'20\'19s 10 biggest trading partners. The goods-trade deficit with the Asian nation is the largest after the shortfalls with China and Mexico.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said last month it doesn\u8217\'20\'19t use exchange rates to create an unfair competitive advantage in trade, and that its \u8220\'20\'1Cexchange-rate management in recent years is within its general framework of monetary policy and aims to achieve the consistent goal of controlling inflation, stabilizing macro-economy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Commerce Department in November imposed preliminary anti-subsidy duties on Vietnamese car and truck tires, citing the nation\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cundervalued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D among the reasons. A new federal rule published in 2020 allows Commerce to treat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undervaluation as a factor in determining countervailing tariffs on a trading partner.\par \par \uc2 (Adds link to report in second paragraph.)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210116eh1g0035q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
