\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 US Treasury\uc2  designates Switzerland and Vietnam as  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  handlers\b0\par\par\uc2 473 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Treasury Department\uc2  has designated Switzerland and Vietnam as \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulators for the first time, and has kept China on a watch list in the Trump Administration's final \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy report.\par \par \uc2 Having withdrawn the manipulator designation to China in January, the Treasury urged the world's second-largest economy to "improve transparency" in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  management, especially in its \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's relationship with state entities, which - according to market players - can act in the officially oriented \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Manipulator designation does not imply specific or immediate consequences, beyond the short-term market impact. But the law requires the Administration to engage with countries to address the perceived exchange-change imbalance. Sanctions, such as the exclusion of \uc2 US government\uc2  contracts,could apply after one year unless the label is removed.\par \par \uc2 "The goal of the manipulator designation of some countries appears to be to gain influence in trade negotiations," said \uc2 Steve Englander\uc2 , head of global analysis at \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  G-10 at Standard Chartered Bank, in a commentary, adding that immediate impacts are limited. "There would be greater consequences if Commerce used the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undercutting conclusions to initiate countervailing duties against industries benefiting from it."\par \par \uc2 Thailand, Taiwan and India were included in the agency's watchlist, which also includes Japan, Korea, Germany, Italy, Singapore and Malaysia.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  rejected the accusations and promised to continue its monetary \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the franc from strengthening too much. \b \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam\b0 \highlight\uc2  also rejected the label,reiterating that its exchange rate management was not creating an unfair competitive advantage.\par \par \uc2 Switzerland and Vietnam met the three criteria used by the Treasury to determine the designation. Trading partners that meet two criteria are placed on the watch list, although China only meets one. The United States has previously designated China as a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulator twice, in the 1990s and last year.\par \par \uc2 "The Treasury will follow up on its findings regarding Vietnam and Switzerland to work towards eliminating practices that create unfair advantages for foreign competitors," Treasury Secretary \uc2 Steven Mnuchin\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Janet Yellen\uc2 ,who, if confirmed, will be secretary to president-elect \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 's Treasury, has previously shown a more sympathetic stance toward monetary policy decisions that have exchange rate implications. In 2019, he said, "It's really difficult and dangerous to define when a country is playing its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to gain commercial advantages."\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for Biden's transition team refused to comment on the Treasury report, which analyzed the monetary practices of 20 major trading partners to detect possible manipulations over fourquarters until June.\par \par \uc2 We recommend you\par \par \uc2 Minimum wage to increase 15% to 141.7 pesos per day by 2021, Conasami agrees\par \par \uc2 Don't stop, go on and on! Bitcoin goes over $21,000 for the first time\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020201217egch006gs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
