\par\par \b \uc2 Reuters Southeast Asia News Highlights 1000 GMT, Oct 27\b0\par\par\uc2 428 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 2010\par 12:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's Merapi volcano kills at least 28\par \par \uc2 SLEMAN, Indonesia - One of Indonesia's most active volcanoes spewed out clouds of ash and jets of searing gas in an eruption that has killed at least 28 people and injured 14.\par \par \uc2 Mount Merapi, on the outskirts of the city of Yogyakarta on Java island, first erupted on Tuesday, a day after a tsunami pounded remote islands in western Indonesia, killing at least 113 people.\par \par \uc2 - - - -\par \par \uc2 Still hope for Myanmar poll credibility - Indonesia\par \par \uc2 HANOI - Myanmar's first election in 20 years lacks credibility but neighbours hope it is not too late to improve prospects for a vote the ruling military says will return the country to civilian rule, Indonesia said on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The 10-member Association of South East Asian Nations (ASEAN) faces divisions over reclusive and recalcitrant Myanmar at an Asia-Pacific leaders' gathering in Vietnam this week.\par \par \uc2 - - - -\par \par \uc2 Philippine c.bank says trying to contain \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings\par \par \uc2 MANILA - The Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets were limited to smoothing wild swings in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , hours after President Benigno Aquino said monetary authorities were trying to keep the peso within a specific range.\par \par \uc2 Aquino, addressing the Filipino community during a state visit in \b \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to preserve the value of the peso <PDSPESO> <PHP=PDSP>.\par \par \uc2 - - - -\par \par \uc2 New Zealand govt reaches deal to keep "Hobbit" films\par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON - New Zealand will remain the home of "The Hobbit" after the government struck a US$25 million deal with Warner Bros. and promised labour law changes to stop the film studio from relocating the big-budget movie production.\par \par \uc2 A short-lived union boycott prompted Warner Bros. representatives to travel to New Zealand this week to review the studio's decision to shoot Peter Jackson's two-part adaptation of J.R.R. Tolkien's fantasy in New Zealand.\par \par \uc2 - - - -\par \par \uc2 New monkey found in Myanmar near China dam project\par \par \uc2 OSLO - A new type of snub-nosed monkey has been found in a remote forested region of northern Myanmar which is under threat from logging and a Chinese dam project, scientists said.\par \par \uc2 They said hunters in Myanmar's Kachin state said the long-tailed black monkey, with white-tufted ears and a white beard, could often be tracked in the rain because its upturned nostrils made it prone to sneezing when water dripped in. (Asia desk, Singapore +65 6870 3815)\par \par \uc2 SOUTHEASTASIA-HIGHLIGHTS 1000 GMT|LANGEN|AFA|CSA|LBY|RWSA|RWS|REULB|GNS|SXNA   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101027e6ar000xr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
