\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam \highlight\uc2  c.bank says dong stable, not  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juli 2008\par 12:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 HANOI, July 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Vietnam\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had stabilised, supply and demand of dong was balanced, and it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dong market since early June. \uc2 State Bank of Vietnam\uc2  Deputy Governor Nguyen Van Binh also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not placed any restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions by exporters or importers, nor had it restrained the black market.\par \par \uc2 He declined comment on Vietnam's interest rates policy.\par \par \uc2 "We did not make any control on the black market because the black market is out of our control," Binh told Reuters on the sidelines of an event.\par \par \uc2 "We made some tightening policy regarding our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  bureau in order to correct the activities within the regulations of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 The dong <VND=>, one of Asia's least convertible \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has steadied this month in a 16,500-16,850 per dollar range. Traders believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and its measures to cool bank lending have helped improve sentiment among investors who at one point in June were pricing in a 30 percent depreciation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within 12 months.\par \par \uc2 Rates in black market deals, in which local Vietnamese illicitly convert their dong into dollars, have also changed. These dollars are now available at close to the official rate, rather than the 13-15 percent premium they used to command in June.\par \par \uc2 Binh, who's in charge of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  between the end of March until early June to stabilise the dong, but he declined to divulge how much had been spent on such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We have stopped \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Binh said.\par \par \uc2 "We did not use \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves so far. We \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  only on the basis of the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  that we purchased from the market," he said.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam does not regularly report its foreign reserves data but a finance ministry official said in June the country's reserves totalled $20.7 billion.\par \par \uc2 Responding to a question on whether there would be changes to Vietnam's policy of allowing the dong to move in a 2 percent band around a daily mid-point, and whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanted to see the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weaken, he said:\par \par \uc2 "In general our policy is that we keep the exchange rate stable but not fixed. We keep it stable but we are flexible to changes in the market."\par \par \uc2 With annual inflation running at 27 percent and after a hefty fuel price rise this week, economists and investors expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise rates for the fourth time this year. (Reporting by Vidya Ranganathan; Editing by Neil Fullick)\par \par \uc2 VIETNAM-CENTRALBANK (INTERVIEW, URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|G|ABX|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080725e47p001ni\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
